ear the Screen Options button). HTML is allowed.":["A jobb fels\u0151 sarokban l\u00e9v\u0151 S\u00fag\u00f3 gombra kattintva megjelen\u0151 tartalom (a K\u00e9perny\u0151 be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sai gomb mellett). A HTML enged\u00e9lyezett."],"Customizer":["Customizer"],"Show this settings page as a panel in the Customizer":["Jelen\u00edtse meg ezt a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si oldalt panelk\u00e9nt a Testreszab\u00f3ban"],"Customizer only":["Csak a Testreszab\u00f3ban"],"Show only in the Customizer, no admin settings page":["Csak a Testreszab\u00f3ban jelenjen meg, ne legyen admin be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si oldal"],"Network":["H\u00e1l\u00f3zat"],"Make the settings page network-wide (in multisite environment)":["Tegye a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si oldalt h\u00e1l\u00f3zatszint\u0171v\u00e9 (multisite k\u00f6rnyezetben)"],"Boxes":["Dobozok"],"No boxes":["Nincsenek dobozok"],"Tabs":["F\u00fclek"],"Tab key":["Tab billenty\u0171"],"Tab label":["F\u00fcl felirata"],"Custom CSS for the wrapper div":["Egy\u00e9ni CSS a burkol\u00f3 divhez"],"Must be unique between settings pages. Use only lowercase letters, numbers, underscores and dashes.":["A be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si oldalak k\u00f6z\u00f6tt egyedinek kell lennie. Csak kisbet\u0171ket, sz\u00e1mokat, al\u00e1h\u00faz\u00e1sjeleket \u00e9s k\u00f6t\u0151jeleket haszn\u00e1ljon."],"Option name":["Opci\u00f3 neve"],"Used as the object ID when getting settings values with helper functions. Takes settings page ID if missed. If you want to use theme mods (to compatible with the settings in the Customizer), set it to <code>theme_mods_$themeslug<\/code>.":["Seg\u00e9df\u00fcggv\u00e9nyekkel t\u00f6rt\u00e9n\u0151 be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si \u00e9rt\u00e9kek lek\u00e9r\u00e9sekor objektumazonos\u00edt\u00f3k\u00e9nt haszn\u00e1latos. Ha nincs megadva, a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si oldal azonos\u00edt\u00f3j\u00e1t veszi fel. Ha a theme mods-ot szeretn\u00e9 haszn\u00e1lni (a Testreszab\u00f3 be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1saival val\u00f3 kompatibilit\u00e1s \u00e9rdek\u00e9ben), \u00e1ll\u00edtsa erre: <code>theme_mods_$themeslug<\/code>."],"Show menu after":["Men\u00fc megjelen\u00edt\u00e9se ezut\u00e1n"],"Show after all menus":["Megjelen\u00edt\u00e9s az \u00f6sszes men\u00fc ut\u00e1n"],"Icon SVG":["Ikon SVG-je"],"Default first submenu title":["Az els\u0151 almen\u00fc alap\u00e9rtelmezett c\u00edme"],"Get PHP code to register the settings page":["PHP-k\u00f3d lek\u00e9r\u00e9se a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si oldal regisztr\u00e1l\u00e1s\u00e1hoz"],"Settings page is updated.":["A be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si oldal friss\u00fclt."]}}}